        <mxCell id="HPUS_hKHGSRQHo0Mds8j-30" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="syncg gw" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="730" y="1040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwV1nBBYbSvm3zP1uHik-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span&gt;&lt;p&gt;In particular, we would like to cover the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Our current plan is to upgrade Sync Gateway first and Couchbase Lite separately. We would like to confirm whether this is the recommended approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Since we are using Capella, what is the procedure for initiating the upgrade? Is it self-service, or do we need to raise a support ticket or request additional permissions?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Can we begin the upgrade process in our Development environment first?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;What is the recommended upgrade and rollback process, particularly in relation to compatibility cluster and client versions?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Regarding freezing/unfreezing the cluster version, can this be managed from our side, or does it require a support ticket?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Are there any metadata or index location changes that we should be aware of following the upgrade?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Would you recommend upgrading directly to the latest supported version, or would a staggered upgrade through intermediate versions be preferable?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="710" x="860" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwV1nBBYbSvm3zP1uHik-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Upgrade Sync GW then CBLIte" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="240" x="890" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwV1nBBYbSvm3zP1uHik-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Open a support Ticket" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="180" x="890" y="1129" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwV1nBBYbSvm3zP1uHik-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Upgrading steps send and email on version to apply staggered Rollback" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="355" x="880" y="1159" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwV1nBBYbSvm3zP1uHik-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Upgrade requires a backup first Check if from Capella&#39;s end" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="375" x="890" y="1189" as="geometry" />
